{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"group2.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"ending"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"Squilliam":[["^you can do this. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^you're strong. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^you can do anything you want. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^nothing can stop bestie on her way!!! ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^Hey Squilliam, nice motivational talk right here! Are you preparing for something?","\n","^oh hiiii bestie!!! ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^nice to see you!!! ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^so yeah. i'm preparing. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^for some BIG BIG stuff. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^okay so, let's pop it: i want to organize a party this week-end. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^Oh cool, a party? To celebrate something?","\n","^friendship!!! ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^and the bakery. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^it's just so nice being here. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^i really want people to come have fun with me. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^but i'm a bit scared... ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^what if this is sending major AWKWARD vibes ;o)? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^what if nobody wants to come?? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^am i being weird right now?? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n",["ev",{"^->":"Squilliam.0.89.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Sure, I guess it is stressful. But what's the worst that could happen?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"Squilliam.0.90.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^I understand your concerns but I think it is very great that you take this initiative!",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Squilliam.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.89.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"worst"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"Squilliam.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.90.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"initiative"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"worst":["^the worst? ","#","^score ","/#","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^you mean, no friends come at all? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^i stay alone at the beach? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^everybody thinks i'm so awkward? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^as i'm sunburning myself, waiting for a hypothetical bestie to show up? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^having to walk back to the break room on monday? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^be like \"oh hey, nice, what were you plans for this week-end?\" knowing that they had something better to do than to come to my party?","\n","^my reputation ruined forever? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^as everyone acknowledged my lack of social skills?? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^and furthermore the genuine disinterest people feel in my company??? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^ahhahaha, come on bestie, you're so funny ;o) ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n",{"->":"squilliam2"},{"#f":1}],"initiative":["^ahahahaaa, right? ;o) ","#","^score ","/#","#","^good ","/#","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^stanning an independant bestie? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^able to do anything she wants?? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^thank you you're sweet. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^i usually feel like bonding with others is so difficult... ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^there is something about it that feels very artificial, right? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^oh hey, how are you doing, what are you up to, blah blah blah ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^but friendship takes time ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^and efforts ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^it's not something you can force ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^so hopefully this time and efforts i put in organizing a party will convince others to love me right?? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^Grasp the nettle Bestie!! uh, Squilliam!! I'm sure you've got this!","\n",{"->":"squilliam2"},{"#f":1}],"squilliam2":[["^no but bestie, hear me out. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^self-prep talks are super important. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^but for this once i feel like i need the support of a super strong and independant bestie like you. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^could you do that for me? pretty please??? i'm litteraly begging right now lmaooo ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^[Squilliam looks at you with a pityful grim and her eyes have never looked so round and wet]","\n",["ev",{"^->":"squilliam2.0.22.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Squilliam, you are enough. It's not about the power to convince, it's about the good heart you put into things.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"squilliam2.0.23.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^Squilliam, you are beautiful, smart and very joyful. I am sure everyone will want to come at your party.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"squilliam2.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.22.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"heart"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"squilliam2.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.23.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"prep"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"heart":["^If you put your heart into things, no matter how good or bad things turn out, you will have something precious to hold onto.","\n","^Nobody can take the good will you put in things away from you, and this is more important than friends showing up or not at a party.","\n","^It's about trusting yourself first, and using your values as your own compass.","\n","^You don't need to show off I promise.","\n","^... wow.... ","#","^score ","/#","#","^good ","/#","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^thank you bestie ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^i ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^i guess you are right ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^i'm feeling very emotional right now ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^SENSITIVE ME am i right?? ;o) ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^no but for real, thank you so much. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^in times of trouble, i hope i'll manage to stay true to my heart. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^and to stand for myself. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^if i can't do that for me, who will? ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^am i right? ;o) ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^at least you are bestie. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^i'll give some more thought to the party program and i'll come back tomorrow to invite you all. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^see ya best bestie! <3 ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^See you, Squilliam! Thanks for the talk!","\n",{"->":"ending"},{"#f":1}],"prep":["^right... ","#","^score ","/#","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^you're right ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^i hope that pretty and smart and joyful is enough for the people to come. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^i'm trying to be my best self ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^and perhaps that will be enough ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^perhaps not ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^hahahhhaha right? ;o) ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^i guess that's how life goes after all ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^thank you for being a bestie by my side. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^i'll give some more thought to the party program and i'll come back tomorrow to invite you all. ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^see ya bestie!! ","#","^squilliam","/#","\n","^Have a nice evening Squilliam!","\n",{"->":"ending"},{"#f":1}],"Inky":[["^... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Are you okay Inky? You seem... very focused...","\n","^I see things. So many things. All happening at once. Like in a perfect circle. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I see the moon hidden by purple cloudes. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I see the sun as its own entity, pursuing an endless race against a clock ticking at every seconds that passes. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I see the essence of matter. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I feel the purpose of solidity, the roughness of air, and the fresh crisp of leaves I'd be walking on if I had feet. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I see chaos as the one true thing reuniting us, for only the tumult can both hold and release what it takes for life to occur, for the world to be, and for all its beings to be at the same time. ","#","^inky","/#","\n",["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.42.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Okay, I'd say that's quite... intense.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.43.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^Omg and is it... bad for us??",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.44.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-2","flg":18},{"s":["^You might have gotten a little too hard on the sniffy thing right..?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.42.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"intense"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.43.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"omen"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["ev",{"^->":"Inky.0.c-2.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.44.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"sniffy"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"intense":["^Intensity and perplexity. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^All working hand in hand. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Each hand at the end of each arm. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Each arms reaching for air. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^So many, many arms. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Like an octopus scooping around. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^In the Void... the mighty Void!!! ","#","^inky","/#","\n",{"->":"inky2"},{"#f":1}],"omen":["^What is good and bad. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^There is square and round. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^There is one and many. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^There is silence and chaos. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^There is purple, red, blue, black. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^A mix of colors all resulting in darkness. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^And finally the Void... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^The mighty Void... ","#","^inky","/#","\n",{"->":"inky2"},{"#f":1}],"sniffy":["^What is sniffing. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^What is smell. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^What is taste. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^What is outside that tries to reach within. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^What is in realms I can't perceive. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^All I do is hear it. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^The Void. ","#","^inky","/#","\n",{"->":"inky2"},{"#f":1}],"inky2":[["^What is this Void you're mentionning? ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^It's nothing and everything at the same time. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^It's where I come from. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I guess I got a little homesick, I'm sorry. ","#","^inky","/#","\n",["ev",{"^->":"inky2.0.20.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Even though I come from a normal place and not The Void, homesickness is a feeling I can relate to.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"inky2.0.21.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^The Void sounds like a cool concept!",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"inky2.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.20.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"homesick"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"inky2.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.21.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"coolvoid"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"homesick":["^You can miss your home. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Or miss a place that felt like home. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Or even miss a place where you felt like a complete stranger. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^As long as there was life... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^There are emotions to be felt. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^And missed. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I am happy we share that feeling, as beings from different worlds merging into one. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Maybe someday I will bring goods from this world into mine. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Like cinnamon rolls maybe? Who knows? ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^So tomorrow is your last day right? ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^We will hold a special goodbye session in the working room. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^It is time to leave I think. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I wish you a delightful night. ","#","^inky","/#","\n",{"->":"ending"},{"#f":1}],"coolvoid":["^The Void is a very cool place yes. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Lacks baked goods, definitely. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^But maybe, someday maybe... ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I could bring some recipe back to my homevoid. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^That would be great. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I'm looking forward to it. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^Tomorrow is your last day right? ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^We will hold a special goodbye session in the working room. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^It is time to leave I think. ","#","^inky","/#","\n","^I wish you a delightful night. ","#","^inky","/#","\n",{"->":"ending"},{"#f":1}],"ending":[["^As everyone leaves the shop for the evening, you notice some leftover treats behind the counter... Leave them for Yuzu the Delivery Dog to find tomorrow morning? Or throw them out?","\n",["ev",{"^->":"ending.0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Leave Yuzu a treat. ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"ending.0.3.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^Throw them out. ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"ending.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],{"->":"treat"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"ending.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.3.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],{"->":"trash"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"trash":["^It's